    "Square entries describe more concrete, diverse advanced academic and career-readiness programs and measurable postsecondary outcomes (AP/IB/dual-credit/CTE/academies) than circle entries": "Groups all evidence of formalized advanced pathways, CTE/CTE academies, dual‑credit/AP/IB offerings and named postsecondary outcomes (scholarships, elite admits), a programmatic/outcomes theme that is orthogonal to both safety/climate problems and teacher/support variability.",
